cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: SPAN
abstract: >-
  A geometric model of effector tethering in R-loop genome editors. Editing
  windows are computed from linker statistics, steric occlusion and R-loop
  geometry, with parameters fitted on terminal-fusion SpCas9 architectures and
  held fixed across orthologs.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
